# qflix-anime-janitor exclusions - titles NEVER auto-moved out of an anime library.
# One token per line (case-insensitive); '#' starts a comment.
#   tvdb:<id>      keep this series in the Anime library
#   tmdb:<id>      keep this movie in the Anime Movies library
#   <bare title>   match by title, e.g.  Cowboy Bebop
#
# Example:
#   tvdb:81797         # a title whose metadata mislabels it; keep as anime
#   Neon Genesis Evangelion
